WEBVTT

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:52.550
Come on out!

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:02.890
Damn it.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.070
I have someplace in mind
I was hoping to take this to.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:18.200
What kind of place?

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:22.660
You'll find out.

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:25.120
Now, let's go.

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:55.490
Who are they?

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:28.910
What is it?

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:32.250
I'm sharing the feed now.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:39.420
What is happening?

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:43.220
James is currently exchanging fire
with unknown assailants at Connor's.

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:52.100
Hey, Mr. Fred!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:08.540
Just to remind you,

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.960
eliminate the evidence within
the time limit and secure Fred.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.090
Calm down.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:26.340
Come out, come out wherever you are!

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.730
Guess I was wrong.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:01.800
Hey.

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:04.760
Ever heard of diversion?

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:13.430
Don't move!

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.950
Come on. Are you kidding me?

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:33.700
Damn it.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.170
We need a change of plan.

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:47.970
Damn you!

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.720
Up here. Let's go.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:03.480
I'll remember your face.

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:38.980
Let's go, then.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:41.350
About Fred...

00:06:49.150 --> 00:06:50.860
No, never mind.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.890
Oh, this, too.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.150
All of these?

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.530
You did ask for everything.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.870
Now, why would a prosecutor
be interested in LIVE?

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.840
My journalistic instincts are tingling.

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.510
I very much appreciate your help.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:03.980
I am doing this favor...

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:09.730
only out of certain expectations.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.870
Very well.
When I'm able to share what I know,

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:19.740
you will be the first I tell.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.750
I promise.

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:26.790
Now it's getting interesting.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.590
What do you want to know about LIVE?

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:37.390
Everything there is to know.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.270
Okay.

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.790
We don't know what else could happen.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:08.670
Make sure you don't let anyone through.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:27.350
Uracil, what are...?

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:52.710
They're...

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:05.140
<i>James, I sent over the results.</i>

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:08.310
Ex-military.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:12.190
<i>Yeah. But no info on them</i>
<i>since their discharge.</i>

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.240
Soldiers with a shady past
became mercenaries?

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.160
Either way...

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:22.530
it's too late.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.960
Now about the other assailants...

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:33.710
Absolutely nothing?

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.630
<i>Yeah, sorry.</i>

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:42.890
They were clearly in a different league
from those ex-soldiers.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:51.730
The LIVE Corporation.

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:58.030
A fast-growing conglomerate
centering on security business.

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:00.320
Publicly,

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:04.030
they're known as the top security company
in the nation.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:10.000
How a small security company...

00:11:10.620 --> 00:11:13.500
was able to grow to this size
in a few decades...

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:18.090
Steven Martland.

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:22.840
Most of it can be credited
to their current chairman.

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:32.100
He was with the first company
the old LIVE merged with.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:39.690
It all began with him.

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:13.480
-It looks like you're okay.
-Yes.

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:17.730
They just attacked out of nowhere
after I called you.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:24.530
The culprits seemed completely different
from the group who were lying in ambush.

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:27.700
What's the analysis?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.500
The group I detained
had their faces mutilated,

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:32.960
but we managed.

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:35.920
I'm thinking they were private soldiers
for LIVE.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:40.460
And the others?

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.980
Mr. Fred Faraday.

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:04.860
The SSC have been looking for you.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:20.000
The SSC...

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:43.650
Founded as a security company,

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:47.950
LIVE received security contracts
from modestly-sized private companies,

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.660
and while small,
had an extremely stable business

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.700
that was very steady.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:56.580
Until this point.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:00.920
They merged with the telecom company,
Commons.

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:05.800
LIVE wanted to incorporate
cyber security expertise

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:09.720
in order to meet their clients' demands
and evolving needs.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:12.350
And Commons

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.810
wanted a stable budget in order to further
technological developments.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.230
They both had what the other needed.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.190
And then?

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:26.820
They continued to absorb smaller companies
and began to grow.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:33.740
Here's the list of their acquisitions.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:44.670
Is that when they started
military contracting?

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.840
Yes, this is the point

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:50.130
when they slowly began to turn into
a private military company.

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:56.140
They also expanded their political
influence to coincide with their growth.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:06.030
There's no question that Martland was
involved in this new change in direction.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:08.030
Which means?

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:11.200
As I said before,
Martland was originally...

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:13.530
with this company.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.040
Of the key people from that time,

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.540
he's the only one left...

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.130
at LIVE.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:31.630
You're...

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:34.510
the SSC?

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:40.810
Wait, so is Monica working with you?

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:45.820
She...

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.820
Monica was killed.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.170
No...

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:08.420
It's...

00:16:09.510 --> 00:16:10.590
It's my fault.

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:12.840
Their first merger...

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:16.890
in other words the old LIVE Corporation's
mergers with Commons,

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.560
was apparently very civil.

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:24.690
Looking at the contracts, Martland,
the representative for Commons,

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:27.320
wanted a stable business.

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:30.860
Then why?

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:35.950
Martland basically took over LIVE...

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:40.120
as if he was
a completely different person.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:43.210
What happened to make him change?

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:49.670
There is always a reason.
I want to know what it was.

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.100
It's like a Bian Lian.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.640
It's a traditional dance from China.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:08.360
The performer changes their mask
instantaneously in front of the audience.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:10.360
Interesting.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.280
In a single moment...

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.400
the virtuous transforms into a demon.

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:18.370
I tried to...

00:17:19.410 --> 00:17:22.370
bring charges against
the LIVE Corporation.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:30.340
Is it related to this?

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:42.470
A colleague of Monica's found these
photographs in her room.

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.240
I met Monica...

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.990
at a function hosted by Ecohes.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:06.460
We talked only briefly,
but I instantly knew

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:10.380
that she was talented
and had a strong sense of justice.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:14.090
I trusted her immediately...

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:18.590
and reached out.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:23.600
I never intended to put her in danger.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:30.770
Mr. Faraday,

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:34.360
could you tell us what this is?

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:41.030
Everyone who used these Masks
had abilities...

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:46.540
you could only describe as super human.

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:50.880
You saw them?

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.210
Yes.

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:56.800
These were...

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:00.890
originally made to save people.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:02.350
And then they...

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:05.770
The Masks are unfinished.

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:08.770
And they probably won't ever be.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.310
In the end,

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:15.400
we never found a way to control its power
or eliminate the side effects.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:19.320
Do you understand?
It needed to be shut down.

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:30.580
But LIVE, or rather my brother,
is still consumed by it.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:34.170
Science...

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.800
Science should never lose sight
of morality.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:47.850
We will now take you in
as a material witness.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:52.350
We'd like you to submit all documents
and everything you know.

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:58.360
Not just on LIVE,
but your brother as well.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:19:59.990
Do you understand?

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:05.410
What would you have done, professor?

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:41.940
It's reassuring you're here.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:46.120
That kind of thing just isn't my forte.

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:05.930
So beautiful.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:12.020
The magic the professor birthed
and I nurtured.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.030
Time to proofread.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.290
I'll be at my desk if you need me.

00:21:36.290 --> 00:21:37.120
Thank you.

00:24:19.450 --> 00:24:21.960
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
